le=\"67-df-theory-closed\">67-df-theory-closed</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"48c6bd62556aaf70\" href=\"?note=48c6bd62556aaf70\" title=\"67-df-decidable\">67-df-decidable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e3ae8bc1f7b51728\" href=\"?note=e3ae8bc1f7b51728\" title=\"essentially undecidable\">essentially undecidable</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"17"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"28"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 在同一有效语言中；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6062469a25ee5f89\" href=\"?note=6062469a25ee5f89\" title=\"67-df-theory-closed\">67-df-theory-closed</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"48c6bd62556aaf70\" href=\"?note=48c6bd62556aaf70\" title=\"67-df-decidable\">67-df-decidable</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)\">\\(\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a>；此处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\nvdash\\bot_L\">\\(U\\nvdash\\bot_L\\)</span> 是外部一致性，可用于未选定有效呈示的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUndec}\">\\(\\mathrm{EssUndec}\\)</span> 是下式定义的元语言谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssUndec}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nT\\nvdash\\bot_L\\land\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cn}_L(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}_L(U)\\land U\\nvdash\\bot_L\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\neg\\mathrm{Decidable}(U)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EssUndec}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nT\\nvdash\\bot_L\\land\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cn}_L(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}_L(U)\\land U\\nvdash\\bot_L\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\neg\\mathrm{Decidable}(U)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条的原书页码及既往核对记录继承自输入档案；本轮未提供原书 PDF，这些记录不表示本轮重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>原书 p.17 定义涉及所有一致扩张，不仅有效扩张。非有效但可判定的扩张若存在，其递归定理集合本身就是有效公理化，故原先限于有效扩张的常见表述在适当有效背景下可等价；本条恢复原书的字面范围。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-theory-closed","status":"resolved","id":"6062469a25ee5f89","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-theory-closed]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-decidable","status":"resolved","id":"48c6bd62556aaf70","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-decidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"essentially undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"e3ae8bc1f7b51728","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_label","heading":"","excerpt":"[[essentially undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-theory-closed","status":"resolved","id":"6062469a25ee5f89","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 在同一有效语言中；$\\mathrm{Cn}_L$ 见 [[67-df-theory-closed]]，$\\mathrm{Decidable}$ 见 [[67-df-decidable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-decidable","status":"resolved","id":"48c6bd62556aaf70","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 在同一有效语言中；$\\mathrm{Cn}_L$ 见 [[67-df-theory-closed]]，$\\mathrm{Decidable}$ 见 [[67-df-decidable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)$ 取 [[67-df-formula]]；此处 $U\\nvdash\\bot_L$ 是外部一致性，可用于未选定有效呈示的 $U$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"U\\nvdash\\bot_L","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssUndec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssUndec}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nT\\nvdash\\bot_L\\land\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cn}_L(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}_L(U)\\land U\\nvdash\\bot_L\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\neg\\mathrm{Decidable}(U)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":207